*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0030
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-07-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-12-09 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 259
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0030.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> CHANNEL O=ONLINE B=BRANCH A=ATM
    05 TXN-CHANNEL        PIC X.
    *> CARD PRESENT Y/N
    05 CARD-PRES-FLG      PIC X.
    05 TXN-AMT            PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 RUN-DATE           PIC 9(8).
    05 RUN-DATE-R REDEFINES RUN-DATE.
       10 RUN-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 RUN-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 RUN-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> HOLD TRANSACTION FLAG
    05 TXN-HOLD-IND       PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 REVIEW-FLAG        PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM ONLINE-SCREEN
    DISPLAY "TXN-HOLD-IND=" TXN-HOLD-IND
    DISPLAY "REVIEW-FLAG=" REVIEW-FLAG
    STOP RUN.
ONLINE-SCREEN.
    IF TXN-CHANNEL = 'O'
        EVALUATE TRUE
            *> CARD-NOT-PRESENT ONLINE PURCHASE
            WHEN CARD-PRES-FLG = 'N' AND TXN-AMT > 3000
                MOVE 'Y' TO TXN-HOLD-IND
                MOVE 'Y' TO REVIEW-FLAG
            *> LARGE ONLINE TRANSACTION
            WHEN TXN-AMT > 10000
                MOVE 'Y' TO REVIEW-FLAG
        END-EVALUATE
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO TXN-HOLD-IND
    END-IF.
